/* P01 213:348：暖白底、白球员卡、红统计、浅色导航、青训照片横幅、整组白卡快捷入口 */
.home { min-height: 100vh; background: var(--club-page); }
.home-body { padding: 32rpx 32rpx calc(180rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); }
.player-slides { height: 548rpx; margin-bottom: 0; }
.player-dots { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 12rpx; padding: 16rpx 0; }
.player-dot { width: 12rpx; height: 12rpx; border-radius: 999rpx; background: var(--club-line); }
.player-dot.active { background: var(--color-brand); }
.player-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 548rpx; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 40rpx; border-radius: 28rpx; background: var(--color-card); color: var(--club-text); box-shadow: var(--club-shadow); }
.eyebrow { color: var(--color-brand); font-size: 20rpx; letter-spacing: 2rpx; line-height: 30rpx; }
.player-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16rpx; margin-top: 20rpx; }
/* V-05：显式约束姓名与切换按钮的伸缩，长姓名省略号截断，完整姓名走切换孩子的孩子列表 */
.player-name { flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%; overflow: hidden; color: var(--club-text); font-size: 64rpx; font-weight: 700; line-height: 88rpx; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.child-button { flex: 0 1 auto; box-sizing: border-box; min-width: 0; max-width: 220rpx; margin: 0; padding: 0 24rpx; min-height: 72rpx; overflow: hidden; line-height: 72rpx; border-radius: 36rpx; background: var(--color-brand-soft); color: var(--color-brand); font-size: 24rpx; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.player-team { margin-top: 8rpx; color: var(--color-brand); font-size: 26rpx; line-height: 40rpx; }
.player-metrics { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16rpx; margin-top: 24rpx; }
.metric-label { color: var(--club-muted); font-size: 22rpx; line-height: 36rpx; }
.metric-value { color: var(--color-brand); font-size: 72rpx; font-weight: 700; line-height: 88rpx; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.metric-unit { margin-left: 10rpx; color: var(--color-brand); font-size: 22rpx; font-weight: 400; }
.player-latest { margin-top: 24rpx; font-size: 24rpx; line-height: 40rpx; }
.player-latest-text { margin-top: 4rpx; color: var(--club-text); }
.milestone-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.milestone-title { margin-top: 48rpx; color: var(--club-text); font-size: 44rpx; line-height: 60rpx; font-weight: 700; }
.milestone-description { margin-top: 20rpx; color: var(--club-muted); font-size: 28rpx; line-height: 44rpx; }
.milestone-link { margin-top: auto; color: var(--color-brand); font-size: 24rpx; line-height: 40rpx; }
.club-banner { position: relative; height: 296rpx; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 24rpx; color: var(--club-text); box-shadow: var(--club-shadow); }
.club-banner-image { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
.club-banner-scrim { position: absolute; top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; left: 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-card) 6%, transparent 74%); }
.club-banner-copy { position: relative; padding: 36rpx; width: 62%; box-sizing: border-box; }
.club-banner-title { margin-top: 14rpx; color: var(--club-text); white-space: pre-line; font-size: 46rpx; line-height: 62rpx; font-weight: 700; }
.club-banner-subtitle { margin-top: 16rpx; overflow: hidden; color: var(--club-muted); font-size: 20rpx; line-height: 30rpx; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.shortcut-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 20rpx; color: var(--club-text); font-size: 28rpx; font-weight: 600; }
.shortcuts { display: flex; gap: 16rpx; padding: 24rpx 0 8rpx; }
/* V-01：快捷入口整组白卡结构 */
.shortcut { display: flex; flex: 1; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 14rpx; width: 0; min-width: 0; margin: 0; padding: 24rpx 8rpx; border-radius: 20rpx; background: var(--color-card); color: var(--club-text); font-size: 24rpx; line-height: 34rpx; text-align: center; box-shadow: var(--club-shadow); }
.shortcut-icon { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 88rpx; height: 88rpx; border-radius: 20rpx; background: var(--color-brand-soft); }
.shortcut-icon image { width: 44rpx; height: 44rpx; }
.shortcut-label { max-width: 100%; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.section-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin: 24rpx 0 20rpx; color: var(--club-text); font-size: 36rpx; font-weight: 700; }
.text-button { margin: 0; padding: 12rpx 0 12rpx 20rpx; background: transparent; color: var(--color-brand); font-size: 24rpx; font-weight: 400; line-height: 44rpx; }
.next-event { padding: 28rpx 32rpx; border-radius: 24rpx; background: var(--color-card); box-shadow: var(--club-shadow); }
.next-event-title { color: var(--club-text); font-size: 30rpx; line-height: 44rpx; font-weight: 600; }
.next-event-time { margin-top: 12rpx; color: var(--color-brand); font-size: 28rpx; line-height: 40rpx; }
.next-event-meta { margin-top: 12rpx; color: var(--club-muted); font-size: 24rpx; line-height: 40rpx; }

.shortcut-editor { padding: 28rpx; margin-bottom: 24rpx; border-radius: 24rpx; background: var(--color-card); box-shadow: var(--club-shadow); }
.editor-title { color: var(--club-text); font-size: 30rpx; font-weight: 600; line-height: 44rpx; }
.slot-picker { padding: 24rpx 0; color: var(--color-brand); font-size: 24rpx; line-height: 40rpx; }
.shortcut-choices { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16rpx; }
.shortcut-choices button, .editor-actions button { width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 12rpx; font-size: 24rpx; line-height: 44rpx; background: var(--color-brand-soft); color: var(--color-brand); border-radius: 16rpx; }
.editor-actions { display: flex; gap: 16rpx; margin-top: 24rpx; }
.editor-actions .editor-save { background: var(--color-brand); color: var(--color-card); }
.configuration-message { margin: 16rpx 0; color: var(--color-brand); font-size: 24rpx; line-height: 36rpx; }

/* L-02：辅助模块局部加载/失败态与重试，失败只影响本模块卡片 */
.milestone-fallback { display: flex; flex: 1; flex-direction: column; }
.milestone-fallback .milestone-description { margin-top: 20rpx; }
.module-retry { display: inline-block; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 24rpx 0 0; padding: 0 40rpx; min-height: 64rpx; line-height: 64rpx; border-radius: 32rpx; background: var(--color-brand-soft); color: var(--color-brand); font-size: 24rpx; text-align: center; }
.milestone-fallback .module-retry { align-self: flex-start; }
.inline-retry { display: inline-block; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 0 0 16rpx; padding: 0 24rpx; min-height: 48rpx; line-height: 48rpx; border-radius: 24rpx; background: var(--color-brand-soft); color: var(--color-brand); font-size: 24rpx; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; }
